{"id":"a817d4e9e855b803","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-constructible-hierarchy.md","title":"可定义子集与构造层级","display":"df-constructible-hierarchy — 可定义子集与构造层级","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-constructible-hierarchy","aliases":["72-df-constructible-hierarchy"],"display":"df-constructible-hierarchy — 可定义子集与构造层级","depends_on":["[[72-df-set-theory-syntax]]"],"chapter":"IV","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV Definition1.2.1, print215/PDF227","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source recursion, empty-domain branch and set-existence checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-constructible-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-constructible-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-constructible-hierarchy — 可定义子集与构造层级"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"676fecd09411613c\" href=\"?note=676fecd09411613c\" title=\"72-df-set-theory-syntax\">72-df-set-theory-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IV"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV Definition1.2.1, print215/PDF227"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source recursion, empty-domain branch and set-existence checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"676fecd09411613c\" href=\"?note=676fecd09411613c\" title=\"72-df-set-theory-syntax\">72-df-set-theory-syntax</a> 的纯集合公式、实际成员结构及变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i\">\\(v_i\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}_s\">\\(\\operatorname{Def}_s\\)</span> 是集合上的可定义类运算，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\lambda\">\\(\\alpha,\\lambda\\)</span> 为序数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\alpha\">\\(L_\\alpha\\)</span> 是由任意集合长的超限递归片段一致确定的类函数值，未将全体序数当作集合函数的定义域。</li>\n<li>对非空 M，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\">\\(\\eta\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\\)</span> 提供全部参数，变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span> 在集合构造中更新为待检元素；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta[v_0:=a]\">\\(\\eta[v_0:=a]\\)</span> 为函数更新。空 M 分支不调用空域一阶语义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}_s(M):=\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\varnothing\\},&amp;M=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\bigl\\{\\{a\\in M:M,\\eta[v_0:=a]\\models_s A\\}:A\\in\\mathcal F_\\in,\\ \\eta\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\\bigr\\},&amp;M\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Def}_s(M):=\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\varnothing\\},&amp;M=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\bigl\\{\\{a\\in M:M,\\eta[v_0:=a]\\models_s A\\}:A\\in\\mathcal F_\\in,\\ \\eta\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\\bigr\\},&amp;M\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L_0:=\\varnothing,\\qquad L_{\\alpha+1}:=\\operatorname{Def}_s(L_\\alpha),\\qquad\nL_\\lambda:=\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}L_\\alpha\\quad(0&lt;\\lambda=\\sup\\lambda).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L_0:=\\varnothing,\\qquad L_{\\alpha+1}:=\\operatorname{Def}_s(L_\\alpha),\\qquad\nL_\\lambda:=\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}L_\\alpha\\quad(0&lt;\\lambda=\\sup\\lambda).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf L\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\ (x\\in L_\\alpha).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\in\\mathsf L\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\ (x\\in L_\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个公式只依赖有限多个自由参数，因此全赋值的写法与原书有限参数列表相同；非空 M 上可把有限赋值扩为全赋值。可定义子集组成集合，由分离、幂集与替换给出；空域只有空子集，故单独给出 {∅}。类 L 的成员资格由公式定义，未把 L 作为 ZFC 集合常元。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-set-theory-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"676fecd09411613c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-set-theory-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-set-theory-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"676fecd09411613c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]] 的纯集合公式、实际成员结构及变量 $v_i$。$\\operatorname{Def}_s$ 是集合上的可定义类运算，$\\alpha,\\lambda$ 为序数。$L_\\alpha$ 是由任意集合长的超限递归片段一致确定的类函数值，未将全体序数当作集合函数的定义域。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"v_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Def}_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"L_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}","display":false},{"tex":"v_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta[v_0:=a]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Def}_s(M):=\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\varnothing\\},&M=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\bigl\\{\\{a\\in M:M,\\eta[v_0:=a]\\models_s A\\}:A\\in\\mathcal F_\\in,\\ \\eta\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\\bigr\\},&M\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"L_0:=\\varnothing,\\qquad L_{\\alpha+1}:=\\operatorname{Def}_s(L_\\alpha),\\qquad\nL_\\lambda:=\\bigcup_{\\alpha<\\lambda}L_\\alpha\\quad(0<\\lambda=\\sup\\lambda).","display":true},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf L\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\ (x\\in L_\\alpha).","display":true}],"bytes":2138,"backlinks":[{"id":"550c278e32aba9e2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L_\\alpha$ 取 [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]]；$\\mathsf{KP},\\mathsf{KP}_\\omega$ 及 $\\models_s$ 取 [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] 的内部语法和实际集合结构语义。$\\alpha$ 为实际序数。"},{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-138","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] · [[72-df-constructible-consequence-norm]] · [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] · [[72-df-set-formula-relativization]] · [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]] · [[72-thm-constructible-transitivity]] · [[72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness]] · [[72-thm-omega-admissible]] · [[72-thm-set-relativization-semantics]]"},{"id":"93bd74c69a0041c9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-135","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] · [[72-df-constructible-consequence-norm]] · [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] · [[72-df-set-formula-relativization]] · [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]] · [[72-thm-constructible-transitivity]] · [[72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness]] · [[72-thm-omega-admissible]] · [[72-thm-set-relativization-semantics]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-508","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] · [[72-df-constructible-consequence-norm]] · [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] · [[72-df-set-formula-relativization]] · [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]] · [[72-thm-constructible-transitivity]] · [[72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness]] · [[72-thm-omega-admissible]] · [[72-thm-set-relativization-semantics]]"},{"id":"761122a1ac76e177","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L_\\alpha$ 使用 [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]]；$\\alpha,\\beta$ 遍历实际序数。"}],"outgoing":["676fecd09411613c"]}